  (global_label "GND" (shape passive) (at 274.32 86.36 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid "e9c13fc4-fd6a-5b3d-ad60-470e8bf6db0b")
    (property "Intersheetrefs" "" (at 274.32 86.36 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) hide)))
  (text "SAO++ power select: the switch common (VLOAD) feeds the AA light and the transistor. Position 1 = badge 3.3 V, position 2 = OFF (pin 2 unconnected), position 3 = coin cell." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 38.1 30.48 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "b76a5725-83e3-50a2-beb6-5eda5757f8de"))
  (text "The badge supply and the coin cell sit on separate switch contacts and are never connected to each other. D7 is the series cell diode docs/standard.md section 3 requires" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 38.1 34.29 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "77e2cbcb-0660-56b2-a11f-bb786ea375e9"))
  (text "(this board is wired to SDA, SCL, GPIO1 and GPIO2): nothing can push current back into the CR2032." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 38.1 38.1 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "af26205b-8287-55e7-8d6f-bdb8a19a9f08"))
  (text "Q1 = two P-channel MOSFETs (the maker's DMP3085LSD). SCL and SDA only touch the gates, through R7 / R8: an insulated input, so the bus cannot feed the board or the cell." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 38.1 41.91 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "d06b1352-b70a-5aab-bf60-e2b49cbcfd8d"))
  (text "A light is on while its line is LOW: OH follows SCL, SD follows SDA. RTS (D4) and CTS (D5) are lit directly by the badge's GPIO1 / GPIO2 pins, about 1 mA each when high," (exclude_from_sim no) (at 38.1 45.72 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "93d1817a-4300-512a-858d-e566d48aa7e6"))
  (text "in every switch position (they never touch VLOAD). SYN (D6) is lit by whatever the user wires to pad TP1 (board-only bare pad, net SYN; no schematic symbol)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 38.1 49.53 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "ac3596f2-cdf9-57b3-9b53-6d40e46c8919"))
  (text "AA (D1) shows that the switched supply VLOAD is present. All six lights use the house 1.3 k resistor (the maker used 47 ohm)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 38.1 53.34 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "e63ecd16-a6f0-5218-9d0a-91e8ac13584f"))
  (text "R1, R2, R3 and R5 sit on the supply side of their LED so that, on the board, another track can pass between their pads (one copper layer, no vias)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 38.1 57.15 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "83318f8d-7763-50f4-ba61-f99537f835c9"))
  (sheet_instances (path "/" (page "1")))
)
